      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the er or anything if i dont have to, its kinda expensive and i'm pretty sure i just overdid it with the lifting. the pain is intense but it's kind of a dull ripping feel, not like a sharp stab. if i take like 1200mg of ibuprofen right now it'll probably kill the inflammation and i can just rest it, right? it's probably just a muscle thing.",
